    <h1 class="article-title">Business Analytics for Ecommerce: 10 KPIs to Track and How to Act on Them (2026)</h1>
    <p class="article-dek">The 10 ecommerce KPIs worth tracking are revenue and orders, conversion rate, average order value, cart abandonment, customer acquisition cost, return on ad spend, customer lifetime value, repeat purchase rate, gross margin and return rate. Track them on one dashboard, review them weekly, and ask what decision each number should change.</p>

    <div class="article-byline">
      <div class="article-avatar" style="background:#2E3A55;">LI</div>
      <div>
        <div class="article-author">Lindsay</div>
        <div class="article-role">Consultant, Tycoon Clap</div>
      </div>
      <div class="article-time">11 min read</div>
    </div>

    <div class="article-hero-art">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 700 320" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <ellipse cx="350" cy="300" rx="260" ry="14" fill="#EAF3ED"/>
        <g transform="translate(70,70)">
          <path d="M0 20h40l30 110h130l25-80H60" fill="none" stroke="#2E3A55" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
